1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,315
Cut a grain open.

2
00:00:01,315 --> 00:00:05,221
The tiny embryo has two sets of chromosomes, like you.

3
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:09,492
The skin is the mother plant's own tissue, also two sets.

4
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:13,671
But the white part, the part you actually eat, has three sets.

5
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:14,960
It is triploid.

